>
  <p>Pickering straddles two eras of housing. The mature neighbourhoods near the waterfront and along Kingston Road have driveways and walkways with real age on them, while the newer communities up through Brock Ridge and toward Claremont are filling in yards that need patios, walkways and shed slabs for the first time. <a href="/">Concrete Toronto</a> works across all of it, and we back each job with a 2-year warranty.</p>

  <p>One honest note for new-build owners: fresh fill settles. If your yard was graded in the last year or two, we may tell you to let it sit a season before we pour. It is not the answer anyone wants, but it is the one that keeps your new patio level five years from now.</p>

  <h2>Pickering concrete, job by job</h2>
  <p>Most Pickering enquiries are for one of these:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-driveways/">Concrete driveways</a>, replacements and new pours</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-patios/">Backyard patios</a> for new and mature lots</li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-walkways/">Walkways</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-sidewalks/">sidewalk sections</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-porches/">Porches</a> and <a href="/services/concrete-steps/">steps</a></li>
    <li><a href="/services/concrete-slabs/">Slabs</a> for sheds and garages, plus <a href="/services/concrete-repair/">repair</a> and <a href="/services/parging/">parging</a></li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Same quote, same warranty as Toronto</h2>
  <p>We do not price by distance. A Pickering job gets the same free written quote, the same materials, the same 2-year warranty and the same satisfaction guarantee as a job down the street from us. We are in Durham regularly, so scheduling is straightforward.</p>

  <h2>Why Pickering homeowners trust us with the pour</h2>
  <p>Fifteen years of GTA concrete behind every quote, and a crew that treats a Durham job like the one down the street. Written prices, kept schedules, clean sites.</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A 2-year warranty comes with the job</li>
    <li>Satisfaction guaranteed, same as Toronto</li>
    <li>Free written quotes, no distance markup</li>
  </ul>
  <p>Send a few photos and a line or two through the form; every job follows the same clear <a href="/#process">six-step process</a>. We are next door in <a href="/locations/ajax/">Ajax</a> and west into <a href="/locations/scarborough/">Scarborough</a>, so one call covers family or rental properties there too.</p>
</InnerPage>
